# Design System in Code

- Import spacing from `tokens/spacing.ts`; use 8pt grid only (8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64).
- Use typography scale and variants from `tokens/typography.ts`; font DM Sans.
- Border radius 8px or 16px only; import from `tokens/radii.ts`.
- Colors via CSS variables from ThemeProvider; follow 60-30-10 (dominant / secondary / accent).
- For special characters (— · © • …) use hex entities in JSX (e.g. `&#x2014;`) or `\uNNNN` in strings (see Rule 11 in .claude/rules.md).
